Medical disclaimer

KathaPulse AI is an educational medicine-safety aid and a prototype submitted to
the NeuraViz AI Challenge 2026-27. It is not a medical device, has not been
cleared or certified by the Central Drugs Standard Control Organisation (CDSCO)
or any other regulator, and does not provide diagnosis, treatment or prescribing
advice. The bundled drug taxonomy and recall notices are curated pilot data for
demonstration, not a licensed formulary or an official pharmacovigilance feed.
Always confirm with a licensed pharmacist or physician before taking, stopping
or changing any medicine.
